				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6 mb-4">
				<p><span class="wpcf7-form-control-wrap" data-name="bank-type"><input size="40" maxlength="400" class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text form-control" aria-invalid="false" placeholder="Bank A/c Type *" value="" type="text" name="bank-type" /></span>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6 mb-4">
				<p><span class="wpcf7-form-control-wrap" data-name="ifsc-num"><input size="40" maxlength="400" class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text form-control" aria-invalid="false" placeholder="IFSC No.*" value="" type="text" name="ifsc-num" /></span>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-9 mb-4">
				<p><label for="association">Are you a member of any trade bodies / associations?</label><span class="wpcf7-form-control-wrap" data-name="association"><input size="40" maxlength="400" class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text form-control" aria-invalid="false" placeholder="(Mention the names Reg. No. and date)" value="" type="text" name="association" /></span>
				</p>
			</div>
