				<p><label for="parent">Techical / Manufacturing / Workshop Floor Areas (m2)</label><span class="wpcf7-form-control-wrap" data-name="techical"><textarea cols="10" rows="3" maxlength="2000" class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-textarea form-control" aria-invalid="false" placeholder="" name="techical"></textarea></span>
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<h5 class="mb-4 border-bottom pb-2">Details of Employees
